## 🧠 5. Real-Time Example

Imagine an online shopping application.

- **Customers Table:** Stores customer details.
- **Orders Table:** Stores order details.
- **INNER JOIN:** Finds customers who have placed orders.
- **LEFT JOIN:** Finds all customers, including those who have never placed an order.

✨ JOINs help applications display related information together.

